        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 98,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD has made known his salvation. He has openly shown his righteousness in the sight of the nations.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그 구원을 알게 하시며 그 의를 열방의 목전에 명백히 나타내셨도다",
      "source_text_hash": "43ea13ffb2dfa38f5b71c7fb72f787f70c176478fb86a90344ab08bebd1051c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "a888d3a344afdb223e6d2b76bcc373bfe873e70c49b5431097eb1052f530ac49",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 그 구원을 알게 하시며 그 의를 열방의 목전에 명백히 나타내셨도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a888d3a344afdb223e6d2b76bcc373bfe873e70c49b5431097eb1052f530ac49"
      ]
    },
    {
